---
import Page from "@layouts/Page.astro";
import Section from "@components/Section.astro";
import LinkButton from "@components/LinkButton.astro";
import SectionHead from "@components/SectionHead.astro";
import SectionSub from "@components/SectionSub.astro";
const title = "Contact";
const subtitle = "Let's talk about improving your website.";
---

<Page title={title} subtitle={subtitle}>
  <slot slot="HeadMeta">
    <title>Contact Chris Kraft | Accessibility-Focused Front-End Developer</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Get in touch with Chris Kraft — an accessibility-focused front-end developer and UX engineer. Reach out to discuss inclusive design, web strategy, or collaboration opportunities." />
    <meta name="keywords" content="Chris Kraft, contact, front-end developer, UX engineer, accessibility consultant, web accessibility, inclusive design, UX strategy" />
    <meta property="og:title" content="Contact Chris Kraft" />
    <meta property="og:description" content="Reach out to Chris Kraft to discuss accessibility-focused front-end development, UX strategy, or collaboration opportunities." />
    <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary" />
    <meta name="twitter:title" content="Contact Chris Kraft" />
    <meta name="twitter:description" content="Get in touch to discuss accessibility-focused front-end development, UX strategy, or collaboration." />
  </slot>
  <Section>
    <div class="typography flex flex-col gap-12 md:gap-16">
      <SectionSub>
        <p>I work with organizations to untangle complex websites—improving structure, accessibility, and front-end execution. If you're dealing with legacy decisions, scaling issues, or unclear next steps, I can help.</p>
      </SectionSub>
      <div class="flex flex-col flex-nowrap gap-6">
        <SectionHead title="Email Me" />
        <SectionSub>
          <a href="mailto:chris.kraft@kriggity.com" class="flex flex-row text-nowrap px-6 py-3 border border-indigo-800 no-underline text-white bg-indigo-800 hover:bg-transparent focus:bg-transparent hover:text-indigo-900 focus:text-indigo-900 duration-300 ease-in-out w-fit gap-4"
            ><span>chris.kraft@kriggity.com</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill="currentColor" d="M22 6c0-1.1-.9-2-2-2H4c-1.1 0-2 .9-2 2v12c0 1.1.9 2 2 2h16c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2zm-2 0l-8 5l-8-5zm0 12H4V8l8 5l8-5z"></path></svg>
            <slot />
          </a>
          <p>I usually respond within one business day. No pitches—just a conversation.</p>
        </SectionSub>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col flex-nowrap gap-6">
        <SectionHead title="Good fit if you're…" />
        <SectionSub>
          <ul class="formatted mb-10">
            <li>Improving or restructuring an existing website</li>
            <li>Navigating accessibility or compliance concerns</li>
            <li>Looking for front-end execution that supports strategy</li>
            <li>Unsure what the <em>right</em> next step is</li>
          </ul>
          <h3>Not sure yet?</h3>
          <p>That's fine—describe what's confusing or frustrating and we'll start there.</p>
        </SectionSub>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col flex-nowrap gap-6">
        <SectionHead title="What happens next" />
        <SectionSub>
          <ol class="formatted">
            <li>You email me with a bit of context</li>
            <li>I'll respond with thoughts or a clarifying question</li>
            <li>If it makes sense, we'll set up a short call</li>
          </ol>
        </SectionSub>
      </div>
      <div class="flex flex-col flex-nowrap gap-6">
        <SectionHead title="Trusted experience" />
        <SectionSub>
          <p class="mb-10">I've partnered with UN-affiliated organizations, SaaS teams, and growing businesses to improve structure, accessibility, and front-end execution.</p>
          <LinkButton slug="/work" slot="LinkButton">View Selected Work</LinkButton>
        </SectionSub>
      </div>
    </div>
  </Section></Page
>
